Master Thesis Code - MSc Data Science (University of Skövde, Sweden)

Title: 


Abstract: 


This repository contains:
1. Preparation for the Experiments:
    - Exploring the Data: EDA.py
    - Creating additional Tables to improve Data Extraction: database_change.py

2. Generation of the different Schemas for each Experiment:
    - Experiment 1 - Numerical Data Representation: schema_1.py
    - Experiment 2 - Numerical Data Representation + Reference Models: schema_2.py
    - Experiment 3 - Textual Data Representation + Reference Models: schema_3.py
    - Experiment 4 - Visual Data Representation + Reference Models: schema_4.py

3. Generation of the LLM-generated explanations:
    - Streamlit App to generate Explanations: app.py
    - Automated Generation of Explanations: automated_interpretation.py
    - Automated Generation of Explanations with Pictures: automated_interpretation_pictures.py

4. Dashboard Creation Files:
    - Preparation of Tables for the Dashboard Creation: PowerBI_Preparation.py
    - Dashboard PowerBI File: Dashboard.pbix

5. Experiment Evaluation Files:
    - Generation of the G-EVAL Prompt Files: GEval_Prompt.py
    - Collection of the Evaluation Outcomes: Evaluation.xlsx

6. Statistical Analysis Files:
    - The Statistical Comparison between G-Eval and Human Evaluation: Statistical_Comparison.py
    - The Statistical Analysis of the Experiments: StatAnalysis.py